<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Broadcast (240)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>broadcast &lt;text&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>broadcast The game will reboot in five minutes.
</pre>
<p>Shows your text, just as you write it, to every player in the game, 
asleep or awake. Your name isn't added: say who it is from if it matters. 
Like echo, but for the whole world instead of one room.
</p><p>It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Echo</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Message</a>
</pre>




</div>